{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgi8yAaqoacV5Gw2AXkoD","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I have now looked at a goal replay on screen. It shows the turned camera, the REPLAY badge, the letterbox bars and the SKIP prompt, with no errors. The full suite passed 103 checks on this build.\n\nThe dive and bicycle-kick animations are the one gap I have not closed. The engine's character rig cannot tilt a body about a chosen axis, so keeper dives and bicycle kicks are approximations. A keeper dive turns the character sideways and lays it down, and a bicycle kick is a flip. Both moves work in play and trigger their events, but they do not look like the true versions. Fixing that needs a new tilt state in the engine, which I did not attempt. I would rather say so than call it complete.\n\nThe Usage field stays \"unknown\" because I have no token or cost figures.\n\nThe HTML file and `exit-interview.json` are in the work folder root, and the JSON parses. The four sections you asked for are unchanged from my previous reply, apart from those two limits."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":308,"cache_read_input_tokens":560158,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":308},"output_tokens":318,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"383f0dbc-f521-4dcc-a5c1-4ea066af957b","uuid":"491807ae-a230-463f-91fb-ee8eafd43c0b","timestamp":"2026-11-04T15:38:47.257Z","request_id":"req_011Cgi8yA8nt5iSS7LaqegXv"}
