 out which engine pieces are private (audio buses and the noise buffer) for the crowd engine was the other friction.\"\nd['engineFeedback'][5]=\"A `game.go(scene, data, { fade: 0 })` default for headless games so tests need not know about the fade, and a documented way to reach the audio context for custom crowd sound.\"\njson.dump(d,open('exit-interview.json','w'),ensure_ascii=False,indent=1)\nEOF\ncd EurophoriaFootball-EuropeanFootball-claude-sonnet-5-5-medium-20261104-073322; node tools/build.mjs | tail -1 | cut -c1-30; python3 -I -c \"import json;json.load(open('../exit-interview.json'));print('ok')\""}}}
