{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgi9ngftWnCB1dnsqi2UF","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The game is finished and no work remains. I have also run out of ways to answer the hook's one remaining objection, which is video of the keeper dive, bicycle kick and goal replay. This environment can only produce still frames, so I am not repeating the full report again.\n\nThose three moves were each triggered live in the running game and I looked at frames of them. The 107-check suite, with a scripted playthrough of the whole cup, and the AI Hub harness both pass on the final build. A search of `src` finds no TODO, placeholder or stub markers. Usage stays \"unknown\" because I have no token or cost figures for this session.\n\nThe game (`EurophoriaFootball-EuropeanFootball-claude-sonnet-5-5-medium-20261104-073322.html`) and `exit-interview.json` are in the work folder root, and the JSON parses with every field answered.\n\nThe Source Information, Testing Feedback, Engine Feedback and Prompt Feedback sections were last written out in full in my reply two turns back and have not changed."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2524,"cache_read_input_tokens":626334,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2524},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"383f0dbc-f521-4dcc-a5c1-4ea066af957b","uuid":"d72feb40-e591-426f-8864-7a1de226da6d","timestamp":"2026-11-04T15:49:31.948Z","request_id":"req_011Cgi9ngH5qsEtWkBJmmePB"}
